  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Little Book of Nature Business</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Little Book of Nature Business will present an opportunity framework of nature business that aims to support the transitionto a nature-positive economy. The Publication will be split into four sections, three of which focus on themost impactful value chains to nature (food systems, construction, and utility services). The fourth sectionwill consider the mitigation and investment potential of other industries that do not embed across thesevalue chains or cut across all of them.</narrative>
  </description>
